{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01800","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难五首 五 · 僧贯休","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见山高海深人不测，古往今来转青碧。\n浅近轻浮莫与交，池卑只解生荆棘。\n谁道黄金如粪土，张耳陈余断消息。\n行路难，行路难，君自看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}